      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kinsey%2C_Alabama",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Kinsey was incorporated in February 1893, then moved to Houston County in 1903, and reincorporated again in August 1957.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
