      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kinsey%2C_Alabama",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Founded in the late 19th century, Kinsey grew around the textile industry, highlighted by the historic Kinsey Cotton Mill.",
